# LastPass for work. mac-apps handles personal Dashlane.

cask lastpass

# Agent CLIs. Each needs a one-time sign-in per machine.
cask codex
cask antigravity-cli            # installs as `agy`
cask cursor-cli                 # installs as `cursor-agent`
cask gcloud-cli

# Standalone Tailscale app. Allow its VPN configuration and sign in manually.
cask tailscale-app

# Dispatch live (rc) sessions need GNU screen 4.06 or newer. macOS ships 4.00.03,
# which can't start a session under launchd.
formula screen
